BAS for CHGame

The game, its art and sound: "BAS" by yokoboko, a PICO-8 cart
(assets/bas.p8), translated to C++. A free, non-commercial port: keep this
credit with it.

The port's framework (Fix.*, P8.*, the tools) comes from Cheleste
(github.com/bateske/CHeleste), and the CHGame libraries are their own
projects' (chgame/ and its licences).
